<title>UK: BOE allots one bln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots one bln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with one billion stg of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of 1.35 billion stg.</p>
<p>It allotted 19 million stg in bills maturing on or before August 18 and 981 million in 6.75 percent repos to August 18.</p>
